bb-plugin-planning-with-files
=============================

The three-file plan format (task_plan.md, findings.md, progress.md) and the
tool vocabulary (pwf_init / pwf_status / pwf_check) follow
OthmanAdi/planning-with-files and its OpenCode port, both MIT.

No upstream code is copied: those implementations are OpenCode plugins built
on hook surfaces (per-turn context injection, post-write reminders, compaction
flush, session-idle gate) that BB does not expose. This port keeps the file
discipline and the completion gate, and states plainly what it cannot do.

Everything in this repository is MIT, original work by prismatic7.
